This product is an independent implementation for the OpenCode plugin API.
It contains no code from, and is not derived from, any third-party project.

Prior art / inspiration
------------------------

The idea of a configurable prompt-injection layer for a coding harness,
including named prompt profiles, swappable rulesets and a documented
resolution order, was popularised by:

  dsh-purge — https://github.com/YuJunZhiXue/dsh-purge
  by YuJunZhiXue, for DeepSeek Harness.

This project is not affiliated with that project or with DeepSeek.
It targets a different host (OpenCode v2), uses a different mechanism
(plugin hooks rather than patching vendor packages), and shares no code,
prompts or configuration format with it. Credit is given here as a
courtesy to the original work.

DeepSeek Harness is a product of DeepSeek. OpenCode is a product of its
respective authors. Neither is affiliated with this project.
